WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,430
I don't have a single piece of myself left, so I can give it all to you.

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,290
good guy

3
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:07,490
Our school is not a film and television school either.

4
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:11,730
How come the senior is better at acting than the actor? Okay, I guess you’re interested.

5
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:12,970
There will be more next time

6
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,850
Just give me more

7
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,050
Why do you call this meat rotten meat?

8
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,730
It's still black, right?

9
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,410
Rotten meat is meat that has been stored for two days and is safe to eat.

10
00:00:22,690 --> 00:00:24,090
I kept it for a few days and couldn't bear to eat it.

11
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:28,690
Now I'll give it to my aunt. You can eat it, okay? I'll eat it first and then I'll have the meat.

12
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,770
Remember to treat me well the first time

13
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:31,770
good aunt

14
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:32,890
You need to eat more

15
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,560
Good or bad

16
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:40,660
I declare that the next Oscar is yours

17
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,440
Okay, get up, I'm going to cook, right, senior

18
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,880
The potatoes seem to be ready. Do you want to eat a few? You are tired of just eating meat.
